---
// LAB de diseño de Grupo Spazi Monterrey - direccion "Editorial de obra".
// Pagina autocontenida, sin indexar. No comparte estilos con el sitio real.
// Fotografia dramatica full-bleed + Manrope enorme + barra de specs mono como firma.
// No tocar el sitio real hasta que Roberto apruebe una direccion.
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es-MX">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" />
  <title>Lab · Editorial de obra · Grupo Spazi Monterrey</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      /* Editorial de obra - navy y gold mandan, naranja acento fuerte */
      --navy:      #0C2554;
      --navy-deep: #0A1B3D;
      --gold:      #C8A84B;
      --gold-hi:   #E4C15A;
      --orange:    #EC6B2D;
      --orange-so: #F4A46B;
      --crema:     #F7F3EA;
      --papel:     #FBF9F3;
      --tinta:     #12203B;
      --muted:     #5C6A80;
      --line:      #E4DECF;
      --white:     #FFFFFF;

      --r-sm: 4px;
      --r-md: 6px;
      --r-lg: 8px;
      --maxw: 1180px;
      --ease: cubic-bezier(.2,.75,.2,1);
    }

    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
      background: var(--papel);
      color: var(--tinta);
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
    }
    .wrap { max-width: var(--maxw); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
    ::selection { background: var(--orange); color: #fff; }

    /* ---- Barra superior del lab ---- */
    .lab-bar {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 60;
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--papel) 82%, transparent);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px) saturate(1.2);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .lab-bar-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; height: 54px; gap: 1rem; }
    .lab-bar .brand { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: .7rem; min-width: 0; }
    .lab-bar .tag { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .7rem; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--navy); font-weight: 600; }
    .lab-bar .dir { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .68rem; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--orange); white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
    .lab-bar a.back { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .72rem; color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: .03em; white-space: nowrap; transition: color .2s var(--ease); }
    .lab-bar a.back:hover { color: var(--navy); }

    /* ---- Estructura del lab ---- */
    .lab-section { padding: 5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .lab-head { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 2.8rem; }
    .lab-num { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 2.6rem; font-weight: 500; line-height: .85; color: var(--line); -webkit-text-stroke: 0; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    .lab-title { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.3rem); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.02em; line-height: 1.05; }
    .lab-note { font-size: .95rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 62ch; margin-top: .5rem; }

    /* ---- Intro ---- */
    .kicker { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .74rem; letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--orange); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .6rem; font-weight: 500; }
    .kicker::before { content: ''; width: 26px; height: 2px; background: var(--orange); }
    .d-huge { font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 7vw, 5rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: .98; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
    .d-huge em { font-style: normal; color: var(--orange); }
    .body-lg { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--tinta); max-width: 64ch; line-height: 1.55; }

    /* ---- 1. Tokens ---- */
    .swatches { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(150px,1fr)); gap: .8rem; }
    .sw { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--r-lg); overflow: hidden; background: var(--white); transition: transform .25s var(--ease), box-shadow .25s var(--ease); }
    .sw:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(12,37,84,.12); }
    .sw .chip { height: 82px; }
    .sw .meta { padding: .65rem .75rem; }
    .sw .name { font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 700; }
    .sw .role { font-size: .72rem; color: var(--muted); }
    .sw .hex { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .72rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: .15rem; }

    /* ---- 2. Tipografia ---- */
    .type-row { padding: 1.3rem 0; border-top: 1px dashed var(--line); }
    .type-row:first-child { border-top: none; }
    .type-label { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .68rem; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: .5rem; }
    .t-display { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4.2rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: .98; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
    .t-display em { font-style: normal; color: var(--orange); }
    .t-h2 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.02em; line-height: 1.08; }
    .t-lead { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--tinta); max-width: 60ch; }
    .t-body { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 62ch; }
    .t-mono { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .84rem; color: var(--navy); letter-spacing: .02em; }
    .weights { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.4rem; align-items: baseline; }
    .weights span { font-size: 1.7rem; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    .weights .wl { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .62rem; color: var(--muted); display: block; letter-spacing: .06em; }

    /* ---- 3. Firma ---- */
    /* Barra de specs mono (marquee) */
    .specbar {
      background: var(--navy); color: var(--crema); border-radius: var(--r-lg);
      overflow: hidden; position: relative; border: 1px solid var(--navy-deep);
    }
    .specbar .track { display: flex; gap: 0; width: max-content; animation: marquee 32s linear infinite; }
    .specbar:hover .track { animation-play-state: paused; }
    .specbar .item { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .8rem; padding: .95rem 1.6rem; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .74rem; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; white-space: nowrap; }
    .specbar .item b { color: var(--gold-hi); font-weight: 600; }
    .specbar .item .dot { width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--orange); }
    @keyframes marquee { to { transform: translateX(-50%); } }

    /* Numeros de seccion grandes - demo */
    .signature-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr; gap: 1.4rem; margin-top: 1.4rem; }
    .sig-card { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--r-lg); background: var(--white); padding: 1.6rem; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
    .sig-card .big-num { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 6rem; font-weight: 500; line-height: .8; color: var(--navy); letter-spacing: -.04em; }
    .sig-card .big-num .frac { color: var(--orange); }
    .sig-card h5 { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 1rem 0 .3rem; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
    .sig-card p { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--muted); }

    /* Hover-zoom demo */
    .zoom-demo { border-radius: var(--r-lg); overflow: hidden; position: relative; height: 100%; min-height: 240px; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .zoom-demo img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; transition: transform .6s var(--ease); }
    .zoom-demo:hover img { transform: scale(1.08); }
    .zoom-demo .cap { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; padding: 1rem 1.1rem; background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(10,27,61,.88)); color: #fff; }
    .zoom-demo .cap .m { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .64rem; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold-hi); }
    .zoom-demo .cap .t { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-top: .2rem; }

    /* Contador demo */
    .counter-strip { display: flex; gap: 2.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 1.4rem; padding: 1.6rem 1.8rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--r-lg); background: var(--crema); }

    /* ---- 4. Componentes ---- */
    .grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px,1fr)); gap: 1.2rem; }
    .demo { background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--r-lg); padding: 1.7rem; }
    .demo h4 { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .68rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .12em; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 1.1rem; }

    .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .55rem; font-weight: 700; font-size: .92rem; padding: .85rem 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--r-md); border: none; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; transition: transform .2s var(--ease), box-shadow .25s var(--ease), background .2s var(--ease); font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
    .btn svg { width: 17px; height: 17px; }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--orange); color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(236,107,45,.28); }
    .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 12px 26px rgba(236,107,45,.36); background: #f2762f; }
    .btn-navy { background: var(--navy); color: var(--crema); }
    .btn-navy:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); background: var(--navy-deep); box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(12,37,84,.28); }
    .btn-ghost { background: transparent; color: var(--navy); border: 1.5px solid var(--navy); }
    .btn-ghost:hover { background: var(--navy); color: var(--crema); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .btn-wa { background: #1FA855; color: #fff; }
    .btn-wa:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); background: #23b95e; box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(31,168,85,.3); }

    /* Boton magnetico */
    .btn-mag { will-change: transform; }

    .chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .55rem; }
    .spec-chip { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .72rem; padding: .38rem .8rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 100px; color: var(--tinta); background: var(--papel); transition: border-color .2s var(--ease), color .2s var(--ease); }
    .spec-chip:hover { border-color: var(--orange); }
    .spec-chip b { color: var(--orange); font-weight: 600; }

    /* Tarjeta de servicio con foto */
    .svc-card { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--r-lg); overflow: hidden; background: var(--white); transition: transform .3s var(--ease), box-shadow .3s var(--ease); }
    .svc-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(12,37,84,.14); }
    .svc-card .ph { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 16/10; overflow: hidden; }
    .svc-card .ph img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform .6s var(--ease); }
    .svc-card:hover .ph img { transform: scale(1.07); }
    .svc-card .ph .num { position: absolute; top: .8rem; left: .9rem; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .68rem; letter-spacing: .12em; color: #fff; background: rgba(10,27,61,.72); backdrop-filter: blur(4px); padding: .25rem .55rem; border-radius: var(--r-sm); }
    .svc-card .bd { padding: 1.3rem 1.4rem; }
    .svc-card .bd h5 { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.01em; margin-bottom: .35rem; }
    .svc-card .bd p { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--muted); }
    .svc-card .bd .meta { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .68rem; color: var(--navy); letter-spacing: .06em; margin-top: .8rem; padding-top: .8rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }

    /* Stats */
    .stat { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .stat .n { font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; color: var(--navy); letter-spacing: -.03em; }
    .stat .n sup { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--orange); vertical-align: super; font-weight: 700; }
    .stat .l { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .68rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .1em; color: var(--muted); margin-top: .5rem; }
    .stat-row { display: flex; gap: 3rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    /* Testimonio */
    .quote { background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-left: 3px solid var(--orange); border-radius: var(--r-md); padding: 1.6rem; }
    .quote p { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--tinta); margin-bottom: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
    .quote .who { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .15rem; }
    .quote .who b { font-size: .92rem; font-weight: 700; }
    .quote .who span { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .68rem; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: .06em; }

    /* ---- 5. En contexto: HERO full-bleed ---- */
    .ctx { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--r-lg); overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 2rem; background: var(--white); }
    .ctx-tag { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .68rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .12em; color: var(--muted); padding: .65rem 1.1rem; background: var(--crema); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }

    .hero { position: relative; min-height: 620px; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; overflow: hidden; background: var(--navy-deep); }
    .hero .photo { position: absolute; inset: 0; overflow: hidden; }
    .hero .photo img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; transform: scale(1.02); will-change: transform; }
    .hero .scrim {
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10,27,61,.28) 0%, rgba(10,27,61,.05) 30%, rgba(10,27,61,.72) 82%, rgba(10,27,61,.92) 100%),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(10,27,61,.78) 0%, rgba(10,27,61,.35) 42%, transparent 70%);
    }
    .hero .inner { position: relative; z-index: 2; padding: 3.2rem 3rem 4.6rem; max-width: 68%; }
    .hero .htag { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .55rem; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .68rem; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #fff; background: var(--orange); padding: .42rem .85rem; border-radius: 100px; margin-bottom: 1.4rem; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(236,107,45,.35); }
    .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5.2vw, 4.8rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: .96; letter-spacing: -.035em; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; text-shadow: 0 2px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.28); }
    .hero h1 span { color: var(--gold-hi); }
    .hero p { color: rgba(247,243,234,.86); max-width: 46ch; margin-bottom: 1.9rem; font-size: 1.12rem; line-height: 1.5; }
    .hero .actions { display: flex; gap: .8rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .hero .btn-cream { background: var(--crema); color: var(--navy); }
    .hero .btn-cream:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(0,0,0,.25); }

    /* Barra de specs mono cruzando el hero */
    .hero .hero-specbar {
      position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; z-index: 3;
      background: var(--navy); border-top: 1px solid rgba(228,193,90,.28);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero .hero-specbar .track { display: flex; width: max-content; animation: marquee 30s linear infinite; }
    .hero .hero-specbar:hover .track { animation-play-state: paused; }
    .hero .hero-specbar .item { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .7rem; padding: .7rem 1.5rem; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .7rem; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--crema); white-space: nowrap; }
    .hero .hero-specbar .item b { color: var(--gold-hi); font-weight: 600; }
    .hero .hero-specbar .item .dot { width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--orange); }

    /* Grid editorial de servicios */
    .editorial { padding: 3rem 2.5rem; }
    .editorial .ed-head { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .editorial .ed-head h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.4vw, 2.6rem); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.025em; line-height: 1.02; max-width: 20ch; }
    .editorial .ed-head h2 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--orange); }
    .editorial .ed-head p { font-size: .95rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 34ch; }
    .svc-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.2rem; }

    /* Banda de testimonios */
    .band { background: var(--navy); color: var(--crema); padding: 3rem 2.5rem; }
    .band .band-k { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .7rem; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold-hi); margin-bottom: 1.6rem; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .6rem; }
    .band .band-k::before { content: ''; width: 24px; height: 2px; background: var(--gold-hi); }
    .band-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.4rem; }
    .band-q { border: 1px solid rgba(228,193,90,.2); border-radius: var(--r-lg); padding: 1.5rem; background: rgba(255,255,255,.02); }
    .band-q p { font-size: 1.02rem; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 1.1rem; color: var(--crema); letter-spacing: -.01em; }
    .band-q .who b { display: block; font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 700; }
    .band-q .who span { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .66rem; color: rgba(247,243,234,.55); letter-spacing: .06em; }

    /* ---- reveal on scroll ---- */
    .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(22px); transition: opacity .7s var(--ease), transform .7s var(--ease); }
    .reveal.in { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; }
      .specbar .track, .hero .hero-specbar .track { animation: none; }
      .hero .photo img { transform: none !important; }
    }

    /* ---- responsive ---- */
    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .signature-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .svc-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .band-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero .inner { max-width: 100%; padding: 2.6rem 1.6rem 4.4rem; }
      .hero .scrim { background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10,27,61,.35) 0%, rgba(10,27,61,.55) 45%, rgba(10,27,61,.92) 100%); }
      .editorial, .band { padding: 2.2rem 1.4rem; }
      .lab-bar .dir { display: none; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      .lab-section { padding: 3.5rem 0; }
      .lab-num { font-size: 2rem; }
      .stat-row { gap: 2rem; }
      .counter-strip { gap: 1.8rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Barra del lab -->
  <div class="lab-bar">
    <div class="wrap lab-bar-inner">
      <span class="brand">
        <span class="tag">Spazi · Lab</span>
        <span class="dir">Editorial de obra</span>
      </span>
      <a class="back" href="/lab">← Todas las direcciones</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Intro -->
  <div class="lab-section reveal" style="padding-top:4rem">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="kicker">Dirección de diseño</span>
      <h1 class="d-huge" style="margin:1.1rem 0 .8rem">Editorial <em>de obra</em></h1>
      <p class="body-lg">Fotografía dramática como protagonista, titulares enormes con confianza y una barra de datos técnicos en monoespaciada cruzando la imagen. Navy y oro mandan; el naranja entra como acento fuerte, nunca de relleno. La sensación es seria y robusta: hacemos obra de verdad, con 14 años de respaldo. Este lab decide el lenguaje; el sitio real no se toca hasta aprobar aquí.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 1. Tokens -->
  <section class="lab-section reveal" id="tokens">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="lab-head">
        <span class="lab-num">01</span>
        <div><h2 class="lab-title">Tokens de color</h2>
        <p class="lab-note">Navy Spazi como cimiento, oro para el prestigio y un buen naranja de obra como acento de energía. El navy y el oro cargan la marca; el naranja se usa con criterio en CTAs y detalles, jamás como color principal.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="swatches">
        <div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:#0C2554"></div><div class="meta"><div class="name">Navy</div><div class="role">Cimiento</div><div class="hex">#0C2554</div></div></div>
        <div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:#0A1B3D"></div><div class="meta"><div class="name">Navy profundo</div><div class="role">Fondos</div><div class="hex">#0A1B3D</div></div></div>
        <div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:#C8A84B"></div><div class="meta"><div class="name">Oro</div><div class="role">Prestigio</div><div class="hex">#C8A84B</div></div></div>
        <div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:#E4C15A"></div><div class="meta"><div class="name">Oro brillante</div><div class="role">Detalle</div><div class="hex">#E4C15A</div></div></div>
        <div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:#EC6B2D"></div><div class="meta"><div class="name">Naranja obra</div><div class="role">Acento / CTA</div><div class="hex">#EC6B2D</div></div></div>
        <div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:#F4A46B"></div><div class="meta"><div class="name">Naranja suave</div><div class="role">Apoyo</div><div class="hex">#F4A46B</div></div></div>
